[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://sim/data/help_page_def.gd" id="1"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1")
id = "haulers_storage"
order = 4
title = "Haulers and storage"
body = "A building puts what it makes in a small buffer at its door. The buffer holds {logistics.door_buffer_cap} units. When it is full the building stops and shows a warning.

Haulers carry goods from those doors to Storehouses, and from Storehouses to where goods are needed, such as building sites. Hauler is a job citizens take on their own. The Hearth has {building.hearth.hauler_slots} hauler jobs and each Storehouse has {building.storehouse.hauler_slots}. On foot a hauler carries {logistics.haul_load} units at a time.

The Hearth is placed for you. It holds {building.hearth.storage_cap} of each good. A Storehouse holds {building.storehouse.storage_cap} units in all, any mix. Put Storehouses beside a road near your producers.

Citizens fetch their own food and light from the nearest Storehouse, so a home far from any Storehouse means a long walk.

Lumen left in store loses 1% a day."
